# House Hlaalu: the Twin Lamps, Ilmeni Dren, Vivec.
# "Twin Lamps" (HH_TwinLamps1): Jobasha names the abolitionists to a player who has freed more than 15 slaves (5; the
# FreedSlavesCounter set and SetDisposition stand in for the freed slaves and his regard, AddTopic for the Cult and
# Legion "latest rumors" that name the Twin Lamps); Ilmeni, "slavery":
# "They light the way to freedom." 4 (10); Galyn Arvel in Ald Velothi (30) sends the player for J'Saddha at
# Ashalmawia ("travel together", 1: 50), whose own script (jsaddhaScript) logs 70 within 300 of Galyn; Ilmeni
# (100). J'Saddha really walks: ONE walk past Galyn (-88710 128429, the dock's north arm) on the arm's east side;
# he trails ~120-200 behind the player, and a walk ending at Galyn stopped short behind him and left J'Saddha
# ~300 away. AshalmawiaXN20Y30 pinned 11-12 (his mesh was an island); the Ald Velothi dock deck pinned 11-12
# (AldVelothiXN22Y31: mesh lay on the sea floor under it, so he fell in and stuck swimming under the pier).
# PositionCell/Position + `approach` stand in for the travel.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case hh_twin_lamps_start
run
set FreedSlavesCounter to 16
AddTopic "Twin Lamps"
player->PositionCell 883 -243 -408 0 "Vivec, Jobasha's Rare Books"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Jobasha's Rare Books" == 1
approach 05AC1C9F
run
jobasha->SetDisposition 100
talk jobasha
ask Twin Lamps
expect GetJournalIndex HH_TwinLamps1 == 5
bye
run
player->PositionCell 417 -412 -103 0 "Vivec, St. Delyn Canal South-One"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, St. Delyn Canal South-One" == 1
approach 052DA0B7
talk ilmeni dren
ask business
ask slavery
choose 4
expect GetJournalIndex HH_TwinLamps1 == 10
bye
run
player->Position -88600 128329 62 0
until 300 player->GetDistance "galyn arvel" < 2000
approach 05C7B47C
talk galyn arvel
ask slavery
expect GetJournalIndex HH_TwinLamps1 == 30
ask J'Saddha
bye
end

case hh_twin_lamps_escort
defend
run
player->Position -78230 125095 1906 0
until 300 player->GetDistance j_saddha < 2000
approach 0571C324
talk j_saddha
ask travel together
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex HH_TwinLamps1 == 50
bye
walk -88640 128480 54
until 3000 GetJournalIndex HH_TwinLamps1 >= 70
run
player->PositionCell 417 -412 -103 0 "Vivec, St. Delyn Canal South-One"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, St. Delyn Canal South-One" == 1
approach 052DA0B7
talk ilmeni dren
ask slavery
expect GetJournalIndex HH_TwinLamps1 == 100
bye
end
